  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      56.4,
      447.44,
      283.0,
      505.52
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 ofthe Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the LandAcquisition (Amendment) Act No. 28 of 1964, that theGovernment intends to acquire the servitude over thefollowing Land, which is required for a public purpose:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      68.4,
      519.43,
      270.83,
      529.51
    ],
    "text": "Description of the Land/Servitude to be acquired:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      56.4,
      538.64,
      282.87,
      644.72
    ],
    "text": "The allotment of land called 'Paramount Watta' in totalextent of 0.0134 Hectares, depicted as Lot No. 1 inPreliminary Plan No. KU 2383 dated 25.09.2018, surveyedand prepared by the Surveyor General, situated in the townof Kurunegala (Ward No. 5, within the Municipal CouncilLimits, Kurunegala) in Kurunegala North - East GramaNiladhari Division No. 834, in the Divisional Secretary'sDivision of Kurunegala, in Kurunegala District, NorthWestern Province and bounded as follows,",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      56.4,
      658.68,
      282.9,
      692.72
    ],
    "text": "Lot No. 01Name of the Land: Paramount Watta; Boundariea of theland: North By: Paramount Watta claimed by N M Gamage,",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      307.2,
      349.04,
      548.14,
      419.12
    ],
    "text": "Road and Lot No. 3 in Preliminary Plan No. KU 1020, EastBy: Road and Lot No. 2 in this plan, South by: Lot No. 2 inthis plan and Suratissa Mawatha, West By: Suratissa Mawathaand Paramount Watta claimed by N M Gamage; Names andaddress of the claimants: Mrs. N M Gamage, Hotel Paramount,Suratissa Mawatha, Kurunegala; Extent: 0.0134 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      307.2,
      445.04,
      548.57,
      563.11
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land, are herebyrequired to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized inwriting, before me at the Divisional Secretary's office atKurunegala on the 26th day of November, 2018, at 10.00 a.m.and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing(in duplicate) on or before the 12th day of November, 2018 thenature of their interests in the Land, the particulars of theirclaims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude, the amount of compensation and the details of theComputation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
